    "detailed_description": "An idle incremental adventure, and a smorgasbord of numbers that go up!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fight monsters.<br></li><li>Buy upgrades.<br></li><li>Fight even more monsters.<br></li><li>Buy even more upgrades.<br></li><li>Recruit party members, monsters, and even boss monsters.<br></li><li>Craft and enhance equipment.<br></li><li>Make your main character stronger with base camps, temperaments, masteries, affinities and more.<br></li><li>Enhance your party members with latent boosts, friendship boosts, void boosts, bonus boosts and more.<br></li><li>Start a new mission (prestige) and collect 3 different resources, which can be used to hire help, buy more upgrades or to enhance equipment.<br></li><li>Battle across 12 different regions, each with its own set of rewards.<br></li><li>Join a faction, craft Faction Medallions and earn Faction rewards.<br></li><li>A little over 1800 in-game rewards to earn, each of which comes with a small stat bonus.<br></li><li>Unlock new features and new challenges all the way up to level 900!<br></li><li>Offline progress through the Time Bank. Offline minutes are added to the bank and can be used to simulate game time at your leisure.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "An idle incremental adventure, and a smorgasbord of numbers that go up!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fight monsters.<br></li><li>Buy upgrades.<br></li><li>Fight even more monsters.<br></li><li>Buy even more upgrades.<br></li><li>Recruit party members, monsters, and even boss monsters.<br></li><li>Craft and enhance equipment.<br></li><li>Make your main character stronger with base camps, temperaments, masteries, affinities and more.<br></li><li>Enhance your party members with latent boosts, friendship boosts, void boosts, bonus boosts and more.<br></li><li>Start a new mission (prestige) and collect 3 different resources, which can be used to hire help, buy more upgrades or to enhance equipment.<br></li><li>Battle across 12 different regions, each with its own set of rewards.<br></li><li>Join a faction, craft Faction Medallions and earn Faction rewards.<br></li><li>A little over 1800 in-game rewards to earn, each of which comes with a small stat bonus.<br></li><li>Unlock new features and new challenges all the way up to level 900!<br></li><li>Offline progress through the Time Bank. Offline minutes are added to the bank and can be used to simulate game time at your leisure.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "An idle incremental adventure. Fight monsters, buy upgrades, recruit a party, craft equipment, join a faction, battle across different regions, and complete hundreds of rewards. Unlock a variety of fun features and use them to make your numbers go up!",
